---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHead from '../../components/PageHead.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
import PracticePhotos from '../../components/PracticePhotos.astro';
import { routes } from '../../i18n';

const values = [
  {
    icon: 'heart',
    title: 'A respectful atmosphere',
    text: 'A respectful, open atmosphere makes everything easier. Especially in difficult times, it helps to remember: no information gets lost when it is shared kindly.',
  },
  {
    icon: 'access',
    title: 'Step-free & easy to reach',
    text: 'The practice is on the ground floor with step-free access. There is parking close by.',
  },
  {
    icon: 'home',
    title: 'Assisted living',
    text: 'We also provide GP care for the residents of the nearby assisted-living facility.',
  },
];
---

<Base title="The practice" description="How Gemeinschaftspraxis Immensen is organised, GP-centred care and training of doctors and medical assistants.">
  <PageHead eyebrow="The practice" title="Working together for your health" lead="Please book an appointment before visiting us." />

  <section class="wrap values">
    {
      values.map((v) => (
        <div class="card">
          <Icon name={v.icon} size={28} />
          <h2>{v.title}</h2>
          <p>{v.text}</p>
        </div>
      ))
    }
  </section>

  <PracticePhotos />

  <article class="narrow prose section">
    <h2>How the practice is organised</h2>
    <p>
      As family doctors we care for children, adults and seniors. Strictly speaking, you are a patient of “Gemeinschaftspraxis Immensen” rather
      than of one particular doctor – so “my doctor” isn’t quite accurate.
    </p>
    <p>
      Of course, not everyone clicks with everyone. We therefore try to respect personal preferences wherever we can. That won’t always be
      possible – but you will always be treated by us.
    </p>

    <h2>GP-centred care (HZV)</h2>
    <p>
      We offer GP-centred care contracts with the major statutory health insurers, and we take part in regular further training – for this
      and much more.
    </p>
    <p>
      Medicine is becoming ever more complex and specialised, which makes it harder to keep track of everything. Research shows that patients
      get better results when they see their family doctor first and are referred on from there. Family doctors therefore play an important
      role in guiding patients through the system.
    </p>
    <p>
      These contracts also help keep family medicine available close to home. A warm thank-you to everyone who takes part in GP-centred care at
      our practice!
    </p>

    <h2>Training doctors and medical assistants</h2>
    <p>We are proud to train both medical assistants and future family doctors at our practice.</p>
    <p>
      Our experienced staff are highly skilled and well trained, and some have been with us for decades. That is rare these days, and we are
      very grateful for it.
    </p>

    <p class="signature">
      Warm regards,<br />
      <strong>Dr. Jelena Tomic and Dr. Ilsemarie Horst</strong>
    </p>

    <p><a href={routes.digital.en}>How we are going digital →</a></p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .values {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(16rem, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .values :global(svg) {
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
  }
  .values h2 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .values p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .signature {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }
</style>
